  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 4.4,
      "e": 7.4,
      "text": "(suspenseful music)"
    },
    {
      "s": 12.59,
      "e": 16.26,
      "text": "(dramatic orchestral music)"
    },
    {
      "s": 16.26,
      "e": 19.01,
      "text": "(artillery fire)"
    },
    {
      "s": 21.63,
      "e": 23.01,
      "text": "- We're here in Djibouti, Africa"
    },
    {
      "s": 23.01,
      "e": 24.89,
      "text": "for this exercise which is crucial"
    },
    {
      "s": 24.89,
      "e": 26.7,
      "text": "'cause it allows all three elements"
    },
    {
      "s": 26.7,
      "e": 29.01,
      "text": "^from all three ships to get back together"
    },
    {
      "s": 29.01,
      "e": 31.43,
      "text": "^and work as one solid entity."
    },
    {
      "s": 31.5,
      "e": 32.95,
      "text": "It allows us to one,"
    },
    {
      "s": 32.95,
      "e": 34.46,
      "text": "not just exercise the Marines"
    },
    {
      "s": 34.46,
      "e": 36.07,
      "text": "but exercise the equipment"
    },
    {
      "s": 36.07,
      "e": 39.82,
      "text": "and prepare for any situation that may arise."
    },
    {
      "s": 40.22,
      "e": 42.88,
      "text": "(dramatic orchestral music)"
    },
    {
      "s": 42.88,
      "e": 45.38,
      "text": "(tank engine)"
    },
    {
      "s": 45.39,
      "e": 47.64,
      "text": "The tank platoon for the MEU is important"
    },
    {
      "s": 47.64,
      "e": 48.99,
      "text": "because it allows us"
    },
    {
      "s": 48.99,
      "e": 51.99,
      "text": "to provide heavy direct fire support"
    },
    {
      "s": 51.99,
      "e": 53.86,
      "text": "to the ground combat element"
    },
    {
      "s": 53.86,
      "e": 56.45,
      "text": "right there on the battlefield."
    },
    {
      "s": 57.17,
      "e": 59.06,
      "text": "I think my best experience out here"
    },
    {
      "s": 59.06,
      "e": 60.12,
      "text": "would definitely,"
    },
    {
      "s": 60.12,
      "e": 61.34,
      "text": "I'm probably speaking for all the Marines"
    },
    {
      "s": 61.34,
      "e": 62.26,
      "text": "in the platoon,"
    },
    {
      "s": 62.26,
      "e": 64.27,
      "text": "but I think our biggest enjoyment"
    },
    {
      "s": 64.27,
      "e": 66.25,
      "text": "of coming out to Djibouti"
    },
    {
      "s": 66.25,
      "e": 67.86,
      "text": "is probably shooting ammunition"
    },
    {
      "s": 67.86,
      "e": 69.72,
      "text": "and getting out and exercising equipment."
    },
    {
      "s": 69.72,
      "e": 70.8,
      "text": "This is what they live for,"
    },
    {
      "s": 70.8,
      "e": 71.84,
      "text": "this is what they do."
    },
    {
      "s": 71.84,
      "e": 73.05,
      "text": "Any time they get out here"
    },
    {
      "s": 73.05,
      "e": 74.66,
      "text": "and they get to operate the vehicles"
    },
    {
      "s": 74.66,
      "e": 76.23,
      "text": "and do what we do best,"
    },
    {
      "s": 76.23,
      "e": 77.63,
      "text": "they're always happy."
    },
    {
      "s": 77.63,
      "e": 78.9,
      "text": "(artillery fire)"
    },
    {
      "s": 78.9,
      "e": 81.25,
      "text": "(dramatic orchestral music)"
    },
    {
      "s": 81.25,
      "e": 83.79,
      "text": "(artillery fire)"
    },
    {
      "s": 83.79,
      "e": 85.61,
      "text": "Coming out to a new environment,"
    },
    {
      "s": 85.61,
      "e": 88.52,
      "text": "not knowing exactly what to expect,"
    },
    {
      "s": 88.76,
      "e": 89.87,
      "text": "knowing the terrain"
    },
    {
      "s": 89.87,
      "e": 91.94,
      "text": "and knowing what the ranges look like"
    },
    {
      "s": 91.94,
      "e": 94.17,
      "text": "really helps build the Marines' confidence"
    },
    {
      "s": 94.17,
      "e": 96.19,
      "text": "in both themselves and their ability"
    },
    {
      "s": 96.19,
      "e": 99.16,
      "text": "to operate the vehicles as well as confidence"
    },
    {
      "s": 99.16,
      "e": 100.99,
      "text": "in the vehicle itself."
    },
    {
      "s": 101.07,
      "e": 102.98,
      "text": "(dramatic orchestral music)"
    },
    {
      "s": 102.98,
      "e": 105.56,
      "text": "(tank engine)"
    },
    {
      "s": 106.06,
      "e": 108.81,
      "text": "(artillery fire)"
    },
    {
      "s": 109.68,
      "e": 113.35,
      "text": "(dramatic orchestral music)"
    },
    {
      "s": 114.52,
      "e": 115.96,
      "text": "(artillery fire)"
    },
    {
      "s": 115.96,
      "e": 116.85,
      "text": "So annual services"
    },
    {
      "s": 116.85,
      "e": 118.19,
      "text": "is important for these tanks,"
    },
    {
      "s": 118.19,
      "e": 120.38,
      "text": "one, to maintain the operation and functionality"
    },
    {
      "s": 120.38,
      "e": 121.55,
      "text": "of the vehicle"
    },
    {
      "s": 121.66,
      "e": 123.64,
      "text": "but it allows us to pull the engines"
    },
    {
      "s": 123.64,
      "e": 125.16,
      "text": "and check the MBC systems"
    },
    {
      "s": 125.16,
      "e": 126.38,
      "text": "and change the filters"
    },
    {
      "s": 126.38,
      "e": 129.63,
      "text": "and possibly find any leaks or any problems"
    },
    {
      "s": 129.63,
      "e": 132.09,
      "text": "that we may have in the future."
    },
    {
      "s": 132.09,
      "e": 133.85,
      "text": "- We took a break in our training"
    },
    {
      "s": 133.85,
      "e": 135.35,
      "text": "to conduct annual services"
    },
    {
      "s": 135.35,
      "e": 138.15,
      "text": "on our four M1A1 main battle tanks."
    },
    {
      "s": 138.15,
      "e": 140.84,
      "text": "We used the Mike 88A2 HERCULES recovery vehicle"
    },
    {
      "s": 140.84,
      "e": 142.26,
      "text": "to pull the Full-Up Power Pack"
    },
    {
      "s": 142.26,
      "e": 143.51,
      "text": "which is the engine and transmission"
    },
    {
      "s": 143.51,
      "e": 145.31,
      "text": "that drives the tank itself."
    },
    {
      "s": 145.31,
      "e": 147.56,
      "text": "During our services basically what we're doing"
    },
    {
      "s": 147.56,
      "e": 150.44,
      "text": "is we're changing batteries, O-rings, seals,"
    },
    {
      "s": 150.44,
      "e": 152.72,
      "text": "we'll flush out our final drives."
    },
    {
      "s": 152.72,
      "e": 154.25,
      "text": "We also use this time"
    },
    {
      "s": 154.25,
      "e": 155.74,
      "text": "^to identify any maintenance issues"
    },
    {
      "s": 155.74,
      "e": 157.28,
      "text": "^that we have such as leaky components,"
    },
    {
      "s": 157.28,
      "e": 160.06,
      "text": "^broken components, things of that nature."
    },
    {
      "s": 160.06,
      "e": 161.28,
      "text": "^There's a lot more to it"
    },
    {
      "s": 161.28,
      "e": 162.7,
      "text": "^but that's the basic rundown"
    },
    {
      "s": 162.7,
      "e": 164.91,
      "text": "^of what we're doing right now."
    },
    {
      "s": 164.91,
      "e": 166.02,
      "text": "- [Bradley] I think this MEU so far"
    },
    {
      "s": 166.02,
      "e": 167.75,
      "text": "has gone exceptionally well."
    },
    {
      "s": 167.75,
      "e": 169.55,
      "text": "We would definitely like to see more"
    },
    {
      "s": 169.55,
      "e": 171.27,
      "text": "training opportunities throughout the time"
    },
    {
      "s": 171.27,
      "e": 172.74,
      "text": "of the deployment."
    },
    {
      "s": 172.74,
      "e": 176.4,
      "text": "(dramatic orchestral music)"
    },
    {
      "s": 176.42,
      "e": 178.83,
      "text": "During this training we found out with the 11th MEU"
    },
    {
      "s": 178.83,
      "e": 181.0,
      "text": "that sometimes things don't go as planned,"
    },
    {
      "s": 181.0,
      "e": 182.88,
      "text": "so the Marines have to be adaptive"
    },
    {
      "s": 182.88,
      "e": 185.94,
      "text": "and they have to be flexible on their training,"
    },
    {
      "s": 185.94,
      "e": 187.26,
      "text": "one thing that definitely"
    },
    {
      "s": 187.26,
      "e": 188.88,
      "text": "makes the Marines more persistent"
    },
    {
      "s": 188.88,
      "e": 190.75,
      "text": "to what we need to get done and accomplished."
    },
    {
      "s": 190.75,
      "e": 194.41,
      "text": "(dramatic orchestral music)"
    }
  ],
